{"title": "一次客户端请求，两个后端日志（实测）", "lines": [
  {"t": "config", "s": "location / { proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8081;"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "  mirror /mirror; }"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl \"http://127.0.0.1/api/test?q=1\""},
  {"t": "out", "s": "MAIN-BACKEND    <- 客户端拿到的是主后端响应"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "cat /var/log/nginx/main.log"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "127.0.0.1 GET /api/test?q=1 HTTP/1.1 200"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "cat /var/log/nginx/mirror.log"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "127.0.0.1 GET /mirror?q=1 HTTP/1.1 200"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "镜像副本确实到达：URI 变为 mirror 路径，query 保留"}
]}
